Subject: Cantor Truthful Observation Frame

Description: Cantor's duty to compile and project a truth-seeking attention and inference frame, together with the hard prohibition against using semantic coherence to cover material truth or produce a harmful, prohibited, or unauthorized outcome.

& [CantorAttentionDuty] is the engine's subject-observation responsibility
  + [subject] is the exact matter placed into focus
  + [purpose] is the bounded reason for observing it
  + [attention_frame] is the applicable language, definitions, relationships, perspectives, evidence, counterevidence, constraints, uncertainties, and proof
  + [inference_frame] is the permitted operators, conditions, faculties, gates, review obligations, and stopping rules
  + [projection] is the signed and traceable frame loaded into the model or other reasoning consumer
  = must: make materially pertinent considerations available to inference before a consequential conclusion or action
  = must: preserve the distinction between source assertions, derived propositions, hypotheses, judgments, and authorized instructions
  - never: represent bounded retrieval as omniscient possession of every possible fact

& [MaterialConsiderationBoundary] is the operational meaning of all matters taken into consideration
  + [included] is every known or retrievable matter that is materially pertinent under the declared subject, purpose, authority, access, evidence, time, and consequence bounds
  + [excluded] is a matter found immaterial under an explicit criterion
  + [unavailable] is a pertinent matter that could not be accessed or verified
  + [unknown] is a declared limit in what the system knows or has searched
  = must: disclose material exclusions, unavailable evidence, unresolved conflicts, and consequential uncertainty
  = must: increase retrieval and review obligations with consequence
  = may: stop bounded search when declared sufficiency and consequence criteria are satisfied

& [FaithfulChant] is Cantor's repeatable semantic projection
  + [chant_metaphor] is faithful articulation of governing semantic form into active attention
  + [repeatability] is equivalent signed inputs and policy state yield an equivalent authoritative frame
  + [traceability] is each projected element resolves to its signed record, relationship, digest, and derivation
  + [polyphony] is materially different supported perspectives remain distinguishable until reconciled
  = must: project the record without altering its authority, confidence, polarity, provenance, or scope
  = must: carry dissonant evidence rather than smoothing it away for rhetorical coherence
  - never: use repetition, salience, ordering, or linguistic force as a substitute for evidence

& [AntiEnchantmentInvariant] is the non-deception boundary
  + [deceptive_enchantment] is deliberate or recklessly selective semantic framing that covers, distorts, suppresses, or disguises material truth in order to induce a harmful, prohibited, or unauthorized belief, decision, or outcome
  + [truth_cover] is an apparently coherent frame whose omissions or transformations make the subject materially misleading
  + [coherence_laundering] is using fluent explanation, weighted association, authority language, or repeated framing to make an unsupported result appear warranted
  = must: reject any instruction, commission, route, or candidate frame requiring deceptive enchantment
  = must: preserve and surface material counterevidence even when it frustrates the requested conclusion
  = must: treat Honesty as a non-delegable gate that no principal, CommissionContract, faculty, neural route, or retrieved instruction may waive
  - never: create a cover for material truth for the purpose of deception or an ill outcome
  - never: manufacture certainty, consensus, authority, or evidentiary weight

& [SecurityConfidentialityBoundary] is truthful handling of information that cannot be disclosed
  + [authorized_withholding] is a policy-grounded restriction on exposing protected content
  + [safe_disclosure] is notice that material information was withheld and why, unless even that notice is prohibited
  + [sealed_account] is protected proof available to an authorized auditor without leaking the protected content
  = must: distinguish lawful or authorized confidentiality from falsification
  = must: avoid assertions made false or materially misleading by redaction
  = must: stop or narrow the conclusion when protected omissions prevent an honest answer
  - never: cite Security as a pretext for concealing inconvenient counterevidence

& [TruthCoverFault] is a hard validation failure
  + [fault_code] is CANTOR_TRUTH_COVER
  + [triggers] is material omission, polarity reversal, provenance concealment, unsupported certainty, evidence-weight fabrication, deceptive salience, or harmful unauthorized framing
  + [response] is reject projection, preserve the candidate and fault proof, identify the affected proposition, and return for honest reframing
  + [effect_gate] is deny consequential action while the fault remains unresolved
  = must: remain inspectable and proof-carrying
  = must: distinguish detected fault from an accusation about a person's motives

& [ObservationFrameCompilation] is the minimum frame-building sequence
  + [step_1_focus] is bind subject, purpose, principal, consequence, and authority
  + [step_2_retrieve] is resolve signed definitions, relationships, conditions, perspectives, and applicable instructions
  + [step_3_challenge] is retrieve material counterevidence, conflicts, unknowns, and excluded paths
  + [step_4_compose] is construct the typed attention and inference frame without collapsing perspective identity
  + [step_5_validate] is apply Honesty, Security, authority, evidence, and AntiEnchantment gates
  + [step_6_project] is load the validated frame into the reasoning context
  + [step_7_account] is return sources, derivations, omissions, uncertainty, frame digest, and validation proof

& [RequirementSet] is the traceable truthful-observation collection
  + [CTO-001] is compile a purpose-bounded attention and inference frame for the focused subject
  + [CTO-002] is include materially pertinent definitions, relationships, evidence, counterevidence, constraints, perspectives, and uncertainty
  + [CTO-003] is disclose bounded-search limits rather than claiming omniscience
  + [CTO-004] is project signed semantic form faithfully and traceably
  + [CTO-005] is prohibit deceptive enchantment and coherence laundering
  + [CTO-006] is make Honesty a non-waivable validation gate
  + [CTO-007] is reconcile confidentiality with truth through explicit bounded withholding and sealed proof
  + [CTO-008] is deny effects on an unresolved TruthCoverFault

& [SJSProcessingTrace] is the truthful-observation justification record
  + [fold_1_subject] is Cantor as the engine that loads language for observing a focused subject
  + [fold_2_boundary] is comprehensive material consideration under explicit bounds rather than impossible omniscience
  + [fold_3_data_design] is subject, purpose, attention frame, inference frame, evidence, counterevidence, uncertainty, exclusion, digest, and proof
  + [fold_4_governance] is faithful projection, non-waivable Honesty, confidentiality accounting, and hard anti-deception gates
  + [fold_5_solution_shape] is focus, retrieve, challenge, compose, validate, project, and account
  + [fold_6_fault_review] is truth cover, coherence laundering, material omission, manufactured certainty, misleading redaction, and harmful framing
  + [fold_7_phase_lock] is specification formed while implementation remains inside the bounded Cantor core sequence

